@startuml db-image-service
title image-service — базы shop_images_1..4

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #5B4BE8
  HeaderBackgroundColor #F3F1FF
}
hide circle
hide methods

entity "images" as images {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * data : bytea
  * content_type : text
  * created_at : timestamptz
  * updated_at : timestamptz
}

note right of images
  Одинаковая таблица в каждой из 4 баз.
  База выбирается по первому символу id:
  0-3 → shop_images_1, 4-7 → shop_images_2,
  8-b → shop_images_3, c-f → shop_images_4.
end note
@enduml
